Timetables

For some regions the departures per hour of stops are counted from an open
GTFS timetable feed. The database then also credits that feed in the meta
table (key "attribution"), and every API response includes it:

- germany: DELFI e.V. via gtfs.de, Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  https://gtfs.de, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- switzerland: opentransportdata.swiss, terms of use require naming the
  source, https://opentransportdata.swiss/en/terms-of-use/
- netherlands: OVapi (gtfs.ovapi.nl), CC0 1.0
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

